  m_text: A strategic mode centered around a starting double that branches in four
    directions. Players build a dynamic layout while trying to empty their hand and
    avoid scoring points. Each round shifts the advantage, and only the most consistent
    player will endure to the end.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
